# Three deployment modes are available. Copy the right example to terraform.tfvars:
#
#   Mode 1 — Pipeline only (no OpenCTI):
#     cp terraform.tfvars.pipeline-only.example terraform.tfvars
#
#   Mode 2 — BYO OpenCTI (you already run an OpenCTI instance):
#     cp terraform.tfvars.byo-opencti.example terraform.tfvars
#
#   Mode 3 — Full-stack (Terraform deploys OpenCTI on its own spoke):
#     cp terraform.tfvars.full-stack.example terraform.tfvars
#
# See terraform/README.md for architecture details and cost estimates.
